        "created_at": "2017-04-10T18:49:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, really.</p><p>Although my B-i-L gave some really nice and delicate things to his kid when it was tiny and it held up. &nbsp;Mine, no way, they love things to death. &nbsp;But more a comment on the type of fabric used, it just isn't the right kind for drooling and chewing.</p>",
